OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Let us know if you see missing
OL,4,Aarmadillo Stanley'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public is being asked to report
OL,7,Fsightings of a six-banded armadillo
OL,8,Fnamed Stanley on the loose in East
OL,9,FSussex.
OL,11,FThe mammal escaped from Animal Magic, a
OL,12,Fcompany based near Hailsham that
OL,13,Forganises school visits and birthday
OL,14,Fparties.
OL,16,FSightings have been reported on the
OL,17,FCuckoo Trail path between Hailsham and
OL,18,FPolegate.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
