OL,3,GNEWSA'Let us know if you see missing
OL,4,Aarmadillo Stanley'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-owner Chris Coetzer told BBC Radio
OL,7,FSussex that Stanley had "managed to
OL,8,Fforce a door open" to escape an
OL,9,Fenclosure.
